'''Passion''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it for 75 [[coins]] {{Currency|Old Coin}} during the [[Valentines Event 2016|2016 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Passion’s blade is dark red with yellow and orange hearts varying in opacity and sizes over it. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*Passion is the last of the six knives included in the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Valentine Set|Valentine Set]]- the others being [[Roses]], [[Valentine]], [[Blossom (2016)|Blossom]], [[Hearts]] and [[Sweetheart]].

